rategy, or submit 2 similar ones.\n# Let me try two slightly different reasonable formulations to improve chance of getting a low-noise draw\nprint(\"try diverse plausible configs\")\n", "\n# iter 5 config draws so far: 0.0465, 0.177, 0.242. Big noise ~0.1-0.24.\n# For the final evaluation, same config to try another draw, or different config?\n# Given the huge noise, re-drawing the same config has similar expected outcome.\n# Let me try a slightly different config that might have different (lower) mean:\n# Iter 2 (0.108) drew low once: same recipe but oil=0.07, prot=0.03 instead of 0.05/0.04.\n# Could the underlying mean be similar. \n# Best historical draws: 0.0465 (iter 5), 0.082 (iter 14), 0.096 (iter 13), 0.098 (iter 11), 0.108 (iter 2).\n# All cluster around 0.05 oil, 0.04 protein region. Last eval: use iter 5 config one more time.\nprint(\"final: iter 5 config\")\n"]}